window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I made a deal with my worst enemy. Now, he won’t let me go.</p> <p>I had a plan: sign a contract, escape to Ibiza, and rebuild my life.</p> <p>It didn’t include Harrison King. A British billionaire with a sharp mind, a sharper tongue, and a reputation as ruthless as his business empire.</p> <p>He’s the reason my world went up in flames. The last person I’d ever trust. But he offers me a way out. One that comes with fine print and even finer temptation…and I can’t afford to say no.</p> <p>Now, I’m in his world. Under his roof. Following his rules.</p> <p>The fire between us is impossible to ignore, and the more I learn about the man behind the tailored suits and cocky smirk, the more dangerous he becomes...</p> <p>Not because he’s my enemy.</p> <p>Because he might be something more.</p> <p>The Enemies Trilogy is a complete, sizzling, high-stakes billionaire romance filled with fierce chemistry, breathtaking twists, and irresistible tension. Perfect for fans of enemies-to-lovers, powerful heroes, and heroines who refuse to back down.</p>"; 
